      <Comment>Esculetin is a coumarin compound that has a strong antioxidant activity. It exhibits a vast array of biological activities, such as the inhibition of free radical generation, inflammatory markers, influencing of glycemic index, and abnormal functioning of genes in cancer and hepatic failures |CITS: [36293500]|.</Comment>
